source_rows.effect:
When you first learn Sound, choose one expression as your primary method:
voice;
bell;
drum;
zither or stringed instrument;
flute or reed;
whistle;
clap or footfall;
mantra or scripture chant;
bone resonance;
another GM-approved sound practice.
This choice is descriptive unless a variant or feature says otherwise.
You learn to create minor cultivated sound within 60 feet. As an Action, you may create one harmless sound no louder than a shout, throw your voice to a visible point, dampen one small noise, cause one unattended object to hum, or cause a small surface to vibrate.
These minor sounds cannot deal damage, impose conditions, replace a check, transmit complex messages through barriers, or imitate a specific creature well enough to deceive without a check.

